  "products_Acetamiprid_longDescription": "Acetamiprid 20% SP is a systemic, neonicotinoid insecticide that acts on the central nervous system of insects, causing paralysis and death. It is highly effective against aphids, jassids, thrips, and whiteflies in a variety of crops including cotton, cabbage, okra, chilli, and rice.",
