  "products_Chlorantraniliprole_description": "Targets lepidopteran pests by disrupting their muscle contraction.",
  "products_Chlorantraniliprole_longDescription": "Chlorantraniliprole 18.5% SC belongs to the anthranilic diamide class of insecticides. It works by activating the ryanodine receptors in insects, leading to uncontrolled muscle contraction, paralysis, and death. It is highly effective against stem borers, fruit borers, and caterpillars in crops like rice, cotton, and vegetables.",
