  "products_Deltamethrin_description": "High-potency insecticide for agriculture and public health.",
  "products_Deltamethrin_longDescription": "Deltamethrin 2.8% EC is a highly potent synthetic pyrethroid insecticide. It disrupts the nervous system of insects, causing immediate paralysis. It is used in agriculture to control bollworms, leaf folders, thrips, and borers, and in public health for mosquito control. Its high activity means lower dosage rates are required.",
