  "products_Imidacloprid_description": "A systemic insecticide for long-lasting control of sucking pests.",
  "products_Imidacloprid_longDescription": "Imidacloprid 70% WG is a systemic insecticide from the neonicotinoid group. It is absorbed by plants and moves through the vascular system, providing long-lasting protection against sap-feeding insects. It is highly effective against jassids, aphids, thrips, and whiteflies in cotton, rice, vegetables, and other crops.",
