  "products_PrallethrinLV_longDescription": "This liquid vaporizer contains Prallethrin, a synthetic pyrethroid known for its rapid knockdown effect against mosquitoes. It is highly effective in eliminating mosquitoes quickly and providing a comfortable environment. It is safe for use in homes when used as directed.",
