  "products_TransfluthrinLV_longDescription": "This is a ready-to-use household insecticide in a liquid vaporizer format. It contains Transfluthrin, a fast-acting pyrethroid that effectively repels and kills mosquitoes (Aedes, Anopheles, Culex) and houseflies. It provides a convenient and continuous protection system for indoor use.",
